-- **Depth**: bits 12–17 (6 bits, mask `0x3F`, shift 12).
-- **U**: bits 0–5 (6 bits, mask `0x3F`, shift 0).
-- **V**: bits 6–11 (6 bits, mask `0x3F`, shift 6).
-- **Material**: bits 21–31 (11 bits, mask `0x1FF`, shift 21).
